-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GeoNames — ZIP code coordinates
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:   https://www.geonames.org
License:  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
          https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Modifications: coordinates were rounded to three decimal places, and all
fields other than ZIP code, latitude, longitude, city and state were removed.
The data was obtained by way of the `zipcodes` Python package
(https://github.com/seanpianka/zipcodes, MIT), which combines GeoNames
coordinates with the USPS ZIP Locale Detail list (public domain).

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Ski area statistics and addresses
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Vertical drop, trail counts, lift counts, night skiing and terrain park flags
were compiled from https://www.indyskipass.com/our-resorts/east. Base-lodge
street addresses were verified individually against each operator's own
website. These are factual records, compiled independently.

